 "note": "Old map sheets cut into map tiles. a, b: Survey of India sheets. Scans and first placement: Old Survey of India Maps community and Horst Held (Zenodo 18975982, 11367062, 13346102), CC BY 4.0. pinned_to_printed_grid: the sheet prints its 5-minute latitude/longitude grid and was warped so every grid line falls on its true position (tools/oldmaps_refine.py). c: United States Army Map Service, Burma 1:250,000, series U542, compiled 1954 and 1955, printed 1959 and 1960 (public domain); scans from the University of Texas Libraries. These came with no coordinates and were placed by FARA on their printed 10,000-yard grid (tools/oldmaps_ams.py)."
